{"suttaId":"thag6.10","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1900,1918],"vripara":"429"},"segments":{"thag6.10:0.4":"Sumanattheragāthā","thag6.10:1.1":"“Yadā navo pabbajito, jātiyā sattavassiko;","thag6.10:1.3":"Iddhiyā abhibhotvāna, pannagindaṃ mahiddhikaṃ.","thag6.10:2.1":"“Upajjhāyassa udakaṃ, anotattā mahāsarā;","thag6.10:2.3":"Āharāmi tato disvā, maṃ satthā etadabravi”.","thag6.10:3.1":"“Sāriputta imaṃ passa, āgacchantaṃ kumārakaṃ;","thag6.10:3.3":"Udakakumbhamādāya, ajjhattaṃ susamāhitaṃ.","thag6.10:4.1":"“Pāsādikena vattena, kalyāṇairiyāpatho;","thag6.10:4.3":"Sāmaṇeronuruddhassa, iddhiyā ca visārado.","thag6.10:5.1":"“Ājānīyena ājañño, sādhunā sādhukārito;","thag6.10:5.3":"Vinīto anuruddhena, katakiccena sikkhito.","thag6.10:6.1":"“So patvā paramaṃ santiṃ, sacchikatvā akuppataṃ;","thag6.10:6.3":"Sāmaṇero sa sumano, mā maṃ jaññāti icchatī”ti.","thag6.10:6.5":"… Sumano thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
